ces, spying on the neighbors. The Dursleys had a small son called Dudley and in their opinion there was no finer boy anywhere.",startPosition:574,endPosition:752},{title:"Central theme",content:'At half past eight, Mr. Dursley picked up his briefcase, pecked Mrs. Dursley on the cheek, and tried to kiss Dudley good- bye but missed, because Dudley was now having a tantrum and throwing his cereal at the walls. "Little tyke," chortled Mr. Dursley as he left the house. He got into his car and backed out of number four\'s drive.',startPosition:1942,endPosition:2272}],[]);return(0,e.useEffect)(()=>{try{a(s)}catch(e){console.error("Failed to load highlights:",e),a([])}},[i,r,s]),t().createElement(mt.Provider,{value:{highlights:o,asin:i,revisionId:r}},n)},bt=()=>{const t=(0,e.useContext)(mt);if(void 0===t)throw new Error("useSampleHighlights is missing SampleHighlightsProvider");return t},wt=({children:n,className:r})=>{const o=(0,e.useCallback)(e=>(null==e||e.addEventListener("touchstart",ee.Qi),null==e||e.addEventListener("touchmove",ee.l6),()=>{null==e||e.removeEventListener("touchstart",ee.Qi),null==e||e.removeEventListener("touchmove",ee.l6)}),[]);return t().createElement("div",{ref:o,className:"scrollable-content"},t().createElement(i.IonList,{role:"listbox",className:r},n))},yt=()=>t().createElement("svg",{id:"SampleHighlightsPanelSvg",xmlns:"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg",width:"24",height:"24",viewBox:"0 0 24 24",fill:"none"},t().createElement("path",{d:"M10.9985 8.297C12.0115 10.297 13.6935 11.972 15.7175 13.001C13.6955 14.029 12.0145 15.703 11.0015 17.704C9.98854 15.704 8.30654 14.029 6.28254 13C8.30354 11.972 9.98454 10.298 10.9985 8.297ZM10.9995 4C10.5245 4.004 10.0525 4.328 9.98154 4.932C9.51854 8.584 6.32254 11.596 2.70454 12.042C2.25854 12.149 1.97654 12.702 2.00154 12.996V13.002C1.97654 13.297 2.25854 13.85 2.70454 13.956C6.32254 14.403 9.51854 17.414 9.98154 21.066C10.0525 21.672 10.5245 21.996 10.9995 22C11.4745 21.996 11.9465 21.672 12.0175 21.067C12.4805 17